{{Name|Internal|{{Term/Store|Wake Wind||Series, BotW, TotK}}|}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]]  in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Internal|quote=ResistHotAndWakeWind |game= BotW |system= Nintendo Switch |version= 1.6.0 |country= United States}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Internal|quote= WakeWind |game= TotK |system= Nintendo Switch |version= 1.2.1 |country= United States}}</ref>

=={{BotW|-}}==
{{Stub|BotW}}<!-- Info on exact stat increase?-->
Wake Wind is a hidden [[Added Effect]] found on the [[Island Lobster Shirt]] that increases the acceleration rate of [[Raft]]s being pushed by [[Korok Leaf|Korok Leaves]].

=={{TotK|-}}==
{{Stub|TotK}}<!-- Info on exact stat increase?-->
In {{TotK}}, Wake Wind increases the acceleration rate of any [[Vehicle]]s with [[Sail]]s that are being propelled by gusts of [[Wind]]. It is again found on the [[Island Lobster Shirt]].

==Trivia==
* Wake Wind serves as a reference to the [[Hero of Winds]]' command over the [[Wind]] in {{TWW}}.

